# The chapel (Plan 0083): a nave with blue glass windows and two lamps, a transept on its
# north side (placed again, mirrored, on the south through a reflected frame), a west tower
# and a scaffold on a hidden layer. chapel.vox is this file with its MATL, layers and the
# mirrored transept added by `flythrough::structures::chapel_vox`; the structures test keeps
# them in step.
color s 1 150 140 125      # stone
color d 2 92 86 80         # trim
color g 3 60 110 230       # glass (MATL _glass)
color l 4 255 190 90       # lamp (MATL _emit)
color w 5 125 85 45        # scaffold wood
color r 6 72 76 92         # roof slate
model nave at 0 0 12
